## claude ultrareview
usage	Usage: claude ultrareview [options] [target]
body-digest	6343fec56f494183
opt	--help	flags=-h, --help	arg=	:: Display help for command
opt	--json	flags=--json	arg=	:: Print the raw bugs.json payload instead of formatted findings
opt	--no-post	flags=--no-post	arg=	:: Do not post the findings to the PR (the default; accepted for parity with the /ultrareview and /code-review ultra flags)
opt	--post	flags=--post	arg=	:: Post the finished review's findings to the PR as you (PR targets only; one plain comment, not a review)
opt	--timeout	flags=--timeout	arg=<minutes>	:: Maximum minutes to wait for the review to finish (default: 45)

## claude update
usage	Usage: claude update|upgrade [options]
body-digest	cd29f027d8039f59
opt	--help	flags=-h, --help	arg=	:: Display help for command
